:38Z"},{"id":787594777,"node_id":"RA_kwDORNfGD84u8b4Z","name":"pikpaktui-x86_64-windows.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":4856195,"digest":"sha256:6f4f6c6094746b8a5431bbd2c894f012d22596825c8d5d68bb492bb5e719e91b","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-11-24T14:48:37Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:48:38Z"},{"id":787594774,"node_id":"RA_kwDORNfGD84u8b4W","name":"sha256sums.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain","state":"uploaded","size":777,"digest":"sha256:8fdad340bcb941c9931659014669d570a2bf5f71bf8e371f08789ba636975380","download_count":8,"created_at":"2026-11-24T14:48:37Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:48:37Z"}],"body":"Folder statistics now use a per-account SQLite index shared by the CLI and TUI. After the first paginated scan, the core uses incremental updates. Moving files updates both parent paths, and deleting the newest file updates the folder's content timestamp.\n\n- In the TUI, open settings with `,`, enable **Browser Settings → Folder Statistics**, and save with `s`. Cached statistics appear while the core refreshes them.\n- In the CLI, run `pikpaktui stats /Movies -J` to query a folder, or `pikpaktui stats --cached --folder-id ID -J` to read the last result offline. To enable recursive statistics in listings, set `cli_folder_stats = true` in `config.toml` or pass `ls --folder-stats` for one command. Sort with `--sort=size` or `--sort=content-modified`.\n- PikPak Android can update its ARM64 core independently from this release. Use **检查 pikpaktui 更新** in the app's core settings and restart the app to load the verified JNI API 1 library.\n\n## Changelog\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/compare/v0.0.65...v0.0.66\n\n### Changes since v0.0.65:\n\n#### Features\n- feat: ship indexed folder statistics for CLI, TUI and the standalone Android core (f90f646)\n\n#### Other\n- test: compile the JNI test client in its Java package (bb0a7ad)\n- test: isolate parallel folder statistics CLI fixtures (b6c6adf)\n\n\n## Download\nChoose the appropriate binary for your platform:\n- **Linux x86_64**: pikpaktui-x86_64-linux.tar.gz (statically linked)\n- **Linux ARM64**: pikpaktui-aarch64-linux.tar.gz (statically linked)\n- **macOS Intel**: pikpaktui-x86_64-macos.tar.gz\n- **macOS Apple Silicon**: pikpaktui-aarch64-macos.tar.gz\n- **Windows x86_64**: pikpaktui-x86_64-windows.zip\n- **Windows ARM64**: pikpaktui-aarch64-windows.zip\n- **Android arm64 JNI API v1**: pikpaktui-android-arm64-v8a-api1.so\n- **FreeBSD x86_64**: pikpaktui-x86_64-freebsd.tar.gz\n\n"}
